msgid "Optional. Enables automatic TypeSafe Jev classification. Eligible domain names are sent to TypeSafe; leave empty to disable."
msgstr "可选。启用 TypeSafe Jev 自动分类，符合条件的域名会发送至 TypeSafe；留空则禁用。"

